Hi! This is a report template I hacked together with some sample text to show how to use it.
In case you run into any problems, just talk to me or message me on Slack and I'll do my best to fix them!

You can use this on overleaf by copying over the following files.
- .latexmkrc
- main.tex
- 3s-report.cls
- references.bib

When I tested this, I ran into a compile duration limit when I wasn't logged in properly.
If you use the institutional login via TU, this problem shouldn't occur.

If you want to use this locally instead, my setup uses `mactex-no-gui` + the zed editor.
I just run a terminal with `latexmk -pvc` to continuously check for any changes in the files and recompile on save.
